       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. QLSAN11.
      * SANCTIONS LIST COVERAGE CHECK
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY QLSAT11.
       01  WS-COVERAGE               PIC X(8) VALUE SPACES.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-LIST-CODE
           IF SCREENED-UNSC-LIST
              MOVE 'SCREEN' TO WS-COVERAGE
           ELSE
              MOVE 'NOTREQ' TO WS-COVERAGE
           END-IF
           DISPLAY 'LIST: ' WS-COVERAGE
           STOP RUN.
